<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sri Lanka stock market was closed on Friday for a religious holiday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the Colombo all share index ended 2.61 points higher at 617.57, its first rise in 10 days.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941)-434319</p>
